WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
08:00 — Today. Faisal opens Today on his phone — both family cars, next service, fuel trend — before the school run begins.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
08:20 — Fuel tick. At the pump he logs litres and odometer on the phone; glovebox receipts stop being the system of record.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
17:00 — Service on iPad. Driveway iPad shows service history while the mechanic talks; dates visible, no “I think it was March.”

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
21:00 — Docs laptop. Laptop documents hold fictional registration and insurance scans so the second car’s papers are not a scavenger hunt.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
21:30 — Garage overview. Garage overview on the laptop covers both cars. He closes the lid knowing neither is a mystery.

